{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">消防處聯同多個政府部門連日來在新皇崗口岸，進行聯合應急救援演練。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER-0730_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026f4m45LZp1K1786753148.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BORDER-0730_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">包括模擬有人被困升降機，在公共交通交匯處多車連環相撞，大批傷者要分流、急救及送院及大樓內火警，協調旅客及工作人員安全疏散，同步滅火。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER-0730_003.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026A2JILeJhq91786753131.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BORDER-0730_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">參與演練的包括警務處、入境處、海關及運輸署等多個政府部門。消防處指過程順利，提升各部門應急救援、疏散及資源調度的效率。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-15T00:38:27.417349+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}